   "id": "dc-dimming",
   "title": "Dimming by external DC voltage",
   "page": 10,
   "description": "A DC source between ADJ and ground sets the LED current in proportion to its level, IOUT_DC = 0.083 × VADJ / RS, over 0.3 V to 1.2 V. The other pins connect as in the typical application.",
